            <classifier href="http://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20161101/QUDV.xmi#QUDV.DerivedQuantityKind"/>
            <ownedComment 
            xmi:id="ISO-80000.weight._comment0" xmi:type="uml:Comment" body="
                It should be noted that, when the reference frame is Earth, this quantity comprises not only the local gravitational force but also the local centrifugal force due to the rotation of the Earth.

The effect of atmospheric buoyancy is excluded in the weight. [See Comptes rendus, 3rd CGPM (1901), p. 70.] In common parlance, the name “weight” continues to be used where “mass” is meant, but this practice is deprecated.
              ">
</ownedComment>
